(7347148, 1148661, 114285, '<td valign="top">Lydia I''m guessing! Your pooch images are always nicely done. There''s a few things I want to mention ~ I really LOVE the PP on this one, the sepia toning the lovely soft vignetting. I love the dog and how his head is in just the right position on the chair, with his big floppy hair and delicate nose...BUT and yes there''s a BUT,  I do however feel the raggedy chair is a HUGE distraction to what could of been a PERFECT image!  My eye is drawn to the lower part almost immediately.....maybe the chair holds some sentimental value to you, and I''m guessing you may of thought it was a great inclusion, but for me this time, not so, and I say that in the nicest possible way &amp;-)<br/> <br/>Still having said that I will still give you an 8, would of been 10, possibly if you cropped the lower half out or better still have your dog on another chair. I reckon this will still ribbon :0)</td>', 'Lydia I''m guessing! Your pooch images are always nicely done. There''s a few things I want to mention ~ I really LOVE the PP on this one, the sepia toning the lovely soft vignetting. I love the dog and how his head is in just the right position on the chair, with his big floppy hair and delicate nose...BUT and yes there''s a BUT,  I do however feel the raggedy chair is a HUGE distraction to what could of been a PERFECT image!  My eye is drawn to the lower part almost immediately.....maybe the chair holds some sentimental value to you, and I''m guessing you may of thought it was a great inclusion, but for me this time, not so, and I say that in the nicest possible way &-) Still having said that I will still give you an 8, would of been 10, possibly if you cropped the lower half out or better still have your dog on another chair. I reckon this will still ribbon :0)', '2015-05-03 00:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347163, 1148836, 159995, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2015-05-03 07:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7347278, 1148381, 116730, '<td valign="top">Something that''s not a cat...or a dog! Nice.</td>', 'Something that''s not a cat...or a dog! Nice.', '2015-05-03 18:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
