(7349161, 1148661, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue, Lydia. Beautiful shot. I LOVE the raggedy chair. (Love the dog too of course.) My dog has a disreputable old armchair which she loves. And sleeps in when its decent on the back deck. But she doesn''t sleep there or anywhere else when there''s a sleeping pets challenge going on...or anytime I''m near her with a camera. Well done with this beautiful image. It was stand alone top in my lineup. Sorry I didn''t comment during voting, but I gave you 10.</td>', 'Congrats on the blue, Lydia. Beautiful shot. I LOVE the raggedy chair. (Love the dog too of course.) My dog has a disreputable old armchair which she loves. And sleeps in when its decent on the back deck. But she doesn''t sleep there or anywhere else when there''s a sleeping pets challenge going on...or anytime I''m near her with a camera. Well done with this beautiful image. It was stand alone top in my lineup. Sorry I didn''t comment during voting, but I gave you 10.', '2015-05-08 02:32:09.000000', NULL, 0),
